er based on releationship or out of work issues. Everyone must be treated equally and respectfully regardless. \r\r \rPLEASE NOTE: Users inactive for over 5 days without informing a supervisor or myself with a reason will b´\\jÇ,ÑW~¹	LŒAÐ­€¸×Ú£”ÉƒÞ/°WÎ„ËU;ˆ QTtK¯/qa(ÞÃ€ðÈNqn¾‹¤!!°Ñ3%ýJÿ»0Ï€-ðLpoháINSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('16', '0', '9', '1461451163', '0', '1', '1', '733', 'Lee-Delgado', 'hr-828-1042.hd-180-2.ea-3493-1189-1189.lg-280-110.ch-3022-1408-1408.cc-260-1229-62', 'Bank Employee Rules (Please read)', ' All employees must follow the rules displayed on this thread.  We do not have many rules therefore expect employees to follow them. The rules on this thread apply to every rank - including supervisor.\r\rBreaking a rule is called an \"offense\" - if you break ANY rule you will recieve an \"offense point\" and it will be logged on a seperate thread within this forum. If you recieve 3 of these points, you will be fired from the bank and blacklisted from ever re-joining.\r\r1st offense - Verbal warning and sent home for 10 minutes\r2nd offense - Demotion and sent home for 20 minutes\r3rd offense - Fired from the bank\r\r \rI - All employees cannot AFK (away from keyboard) whilst working\r \rII - Employees cannot comitt any crimes whilst working\r \rIII - Employees cannot be disrespectful in any way to collegues or users of the bank. Everyone must be treated equally regardless.\r \rIV - Employees cannot refuse service to a user based on releationship or out of work issues. Everyone must be treated equally and respectfully regardless. \r\r \rPLEASE NOTE: Users inactive for over 5 days without informing a supervisor or myself with a reason will b˜%§É-N]Õòz4*Åê¼NšÑÙ§»INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('17', '0', '9', '1461451346', '0', '1', '1', '733', 'Lee-Delgado', 'hr-828-1042.hd-180-2.ea-3493-1189-1189.lg-280-110.ch-3022-1408-1408.cc-260-1229-62', 'Bank Employee Rules (PLEASE READ)', ' All employees must follow the rules displayed on this thread.  We do not have many rules therefore expect employees to follow them. The rules on this thread apply to every rank - including supervisor.\r\rBreaking a rule is called an \"offense\" - if you break ANY rule you will recieve an \"offense point\" and it will be logged on a seperate thread within this forum. If you recieve 3 of these points, you will be fired from the bank and blacklisted from ever re-joining.\r\r1st offense - Verbal warning and sent home for 10 minutes\r2nd offense - Demotion and sent home for 20 minutes\r3rd offense - Fired from the bank\r\r \rI - All employees cannot AFK (away from keyboard) whilst working\r \rII - Employees cannot comitt any crimes whilst working\r \rIII - Employees cannot be disrespectful in any way to collegues or users of the bank. Everyone must be treated equally regardless.\r \rIV - Employees cannot refuse service to a user based on releationship or out of work issues. Everyone must be treated equally and respectfully regardless. \r\r', '733');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('18', '0', '9', '1461451443', '1', '1', '0', '733', 'Lee-Delgado', 'hr-828-1042.hd-180-2.ea-3493-1189-1189.lg-280-110.ch-3022-1408-1408.cc-260-1229-62', 'The Bank - Employee Rules (MUST READ)', '\r All employees must follow the rules displayed on this thread.  We do not have many rules therefore expect employees to follow them. The rules on this thread apply to every rank - including supervisor.\r\rBreaking a rule is called an \"offence\" - if you break ANY rule you will receive an \"offence point\" and it will be logged on a separate thread within this forum. If you receive 3 of these points, you will be fired from the bank and blacklisted from ever re-joining.\r\r1st offence - Verbal warning and sent home for 10 minutes\r2nd offence - Demotion and sent home for 20 minutes\r3rd offence - Fired from the bank\r\r \rI - All employees cannot AFK (away from keyboard) whilst working\r \rII - Employees cannot commit any crimes whilst working\r \rIII - Employees cannot be disrespectful in any way to colleagues or users of the bank. Everyone must be treated equally regardless.\r \rIV - Employees cannot refuse service to a user based on relationship or out of work issues. Everyone must be treated equally and respectfully regardless. ', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('19', '18', '9', '1461451474', '0', '0', '0', '733', 'Lee-Delgado', 'hr-828-1042.hd-180-2.ea-3493-1189-1189.lg-280-110.ch-3022-1408-1408.cc-260-1229-62', '', 'PLEASE NOTE: Users inactive for over 5 days without informing a supervisor or myself with a reason will be automatically fired from the bank.\r\rThe only people who can issue \"offence points\" are supervisors and above. These will all be logged in another thread.\r\rAny other rules will be posted in response from this thread. By reading this thread you agree to the rules of the bank and understand the consequence of not following them.\r', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('20', '0', '9', '1461451541', '1', '0', '0', '733', 'Lee-Delgado', 'hr-828-1042.hd-180-2.ea-3493-1189-1189.lg-280-110.ch-3022-1408-1408.cc-260-1229-62', 'Offense Point Log', '1st offence - Verbal warning and sent home for 10 minutes\r2nd offence - Demotion and sent home for 20 minutes\r3rd offence - Fired from the bank\r\rAll offense points should be logged here in the format:\rUsername:\rOffense:\r\rOnly supervisors+ can reply to this thread.', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('21', '0', '9', '1461451604', '0', '0', '0', '733', 'Lee-Delgado', 'hr-828-1042.hd-180-2.ea-3493-1189-1189.lg-280-110.ch-3022-1408-1408.cc-260-1229-62', 'Leave of Absence ', 'If you need to take a leave and cannot remain active, please reply to this thread stating the reason and when you expect to return.\r\rYou will be informed by a supervisor or myself if your leave has been accepted.', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('22', '0', '3', '1462005591', '0', '0', '1', '682', 'Allen-ORyan', 'hr-828-1403.ch-266-1426.sh-290-96.lg-280-1189.ea-1404-1189.hd-190-3', '[HPD] Welcome Letter', 'Hello and welcome to all the new Cadets. Also hello to anyone further ranked beyond \'cadet\' within the HoloRP Police Department. We here hope you have a great time. Take it seriours but not too serious and remember to have fun.\r\r\rSigned,\rAllen ORyan', '240');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('23', '0', '3', '1462005895', '0', '0', '1', '682', 'Allen-ORyan', 'hr-828-1403.ch-266-1426.sh-290-96.lg-280-1189.ea-1404-1189.hd-190-3', '[HPD] Cop Rules', 'Hello Personnel,\r\rHere are a few simple police rules to follow while on duty to further avoid being fired or ambushed by abunch of users claiming \"ABUSE\" Also to keep me from having to deal with as much drama as possible.\r\r1) Never startwork and arrest someone within the SAME room. Ex: Someone is wanted for Â¥Â¥, don\'t \":startwork\" and arrest them. Make sure to reload the room first.\r\r2) Never arrest someone using a hoverboard/car. It is acceptable only if the user wanted is using a hoverboard/car.\r\r3) Never commit any crimes UNLESS in turfs as this is one of the quickest ways to be fired from the HoloRP Police Department.\r\rThank you.\r\rSigned,\rAllen ORyan\r', '240');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('24', '0', '3', '1462005989', '0', '0', '1', '682', 'Allen-ORyan', 'hr-828-1403.ch-266-1426.sh-290-96.lg-280-1189.ea-1404-1189.hd-190-3', '[HPD] Cop Rules', 'Hello Personnel,\r\rHere are a few simple police rules to follow while on duty to further avoid being fired or ambushed by abunch of users claiming \"ABUSE\" Also to keep me from having to deal with as much drama as possible.\r\r1) Never startwork and arrest someone within the SAME room. Ex: Someone is wanted for Â¥Â¥, don\'t \":startwork\" and arrest them. Make sure to reload the room first.\r\r2) Never arrest someone using a hoverboard/car. It is acceptable only if the user wanted is using a hoverboard/car.\r\r3) Never commit any crimes UNLESS in turfs as this is one of the quickest ways to be fired from the HoloRP Police Department.\r\r4) Never ask for a promotion, if you do you may be demoted or even fired.\r\rThank you', '240');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('25', '0', '3', '1462396695', '1', '1', '1', '240', 'Logan-Salvatore', 'ca-3187-1228.lg-3202-110-1314.wa-3211-110-110.hr-3163-33.ch-3001-1314-1228.he-3082-1228.hd-209-2', '[HPD] Rules and Guidelines', 'HoloRP\rPolice Department Rules and Guidelines\rAll rules listed below are to be followed by every and all Police Officers. \rFailure to abide by these rules  will result in being fired from the corporation.\r\rAFK Working:\rAFK (away from keyboard) working is falling asleep OR not answering after a duration of time has passed. If you are thought to be AFK working you will be given a 5-10 second countdown to reply. If you do not reply we will assume you have gone AFK and action will be taken.\r\rDisrespect or Disrupting the Peace:\rDisrespect consists of a Police Officer talking down to another member of the Police Department or a Civilian. Police Officers are expected to be respectful to both Civilians and fellow Police Officers at all times. Disrupting the peace means participating or starting any heated argument in public, on or off duty. You are representing the Police Department at all times, keep that in mind when talking to other Civilians.\r\rAbide by the laws: \rAbiding by the laws means youâ€™re expected to follow all official laws at all times, meaning youâ€™re not allowed to break any official laws (:laws). You are however permitted to break the laws if you are within a turf zone. \r\rCamping: \rCamping is defined as staying within a room for longer than needed. You are only permitted to stay in a room for 5 minutes. Staying any longer than that is not allowed except in special cases where people are actively committing crimes and you are required to stay a bit longer. Note that this rule only applies to you when you are on duty.\r\rPersonal Relations:\rPersonal relations means you are not allowed to let your personal relationships with any Civilian to affect your better judgement. When handling a crime you are expected to treat everyone as equals. Any sort of favouritism is not allowed under any circumstances. \r\rOff Duty Law Breaking:\rWhile you are off duty, you are not permitted to law or arrest any Civilian committing crimes in front of you. If a user commits a crime in front of you, you are required to simply dismiss it. If you start work in that room all the crimes youâ€™ve seen before you began working do not exist, only the ones you see whilst on duty are arrestable.\r\rInactivity:\rAny member of the Police Department is not permitted to go offline for longer than 3 days. If you need to take time away from the game, or you know you will be off longer than 3 days you are required to contact the Deputy Chief or the Chief. They will keep a note that you are on temporary leave and will be permitted to stay off for duration of time that you and the Dept. Chief and or Chief discussed.\r\rUnlawing:\rYou are only allowed to unlaw someone with valid reasoning. Reasons such as an accidental law would be acceptable, but removing someone due to you being friends would not be allowed. If a Cadet has made a mistake with lawing someone they are required to immediately use the Police Radio (:r <message>) and notify the highest ranking Officer that is currently available. If no other Officers are currently available the Cadet is allowed to unlaw said person and tell the Deputy Chief or Chief at the earliest time available.\r\rAbusing:\rAbusing would mainly be warning/stunning/cuffing/arresting/lawing/unlawing/spraying a user without a valid reason to do so. Using any of these commands without valid reasoning could possibly result in an immediate dismissal from the Police Department.\r\rEntering a Corporation Workplace:\rA corporation workplace is the area within a corporation room that is only accessible by those who work there (behind corporation gates). Police Officers are allowed to enter these areas at any given time provided you are on duty. If the corporation Supervisor or Manager requests that you leave their work area you are required to do so unless handling official police business. Also note that you are not permitted to AFK (away from keyboard) inside these work areas at any time, regardless if consent is given by a Supervisor or Manager.', '1');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('26', '0', '2', '1464473232', '1', '1', '1', '733', 'Lee-Delgado', 'ea-3493-1189-1189.lg-280-63.cc-3389-82-62.hr-828-1042.hd-180-2.sh-3016-1189.ch-3030-1408.ha-3488-62', 'Hospital Rules and Sendhome Times', 'A user may not Away From Keyboard (AFK) work. This means that a user is not focused during work and is either: not responding, not discharging or not healing. Any user who breaks this rule is subject to a send home of 5 minutes (+5 for every instance)\r\rA user may not break the law whilst working. This applies to every law. Any user who breaks this rule is subject to a send home of 5 minutes (+5 for every instance)\r\rA user may not refuse to discharge or heal a user based on their relationship with somebody. You must complete your job by healing and discharging everybody regardless if you like them or not. Any user who refuses to service a user is subject to a send home of 5 minutes (+5 for every instance)\r\rA user may not be disrespectful, racist, homophobic or offensive in any way consistently towards a co-worker or civilian. You must maintain a professional and mature attitude whilst working. Any user violating this rule is subject to a send home of 5 minutes (+5 for every instance)\r\rA user may not go inactive (without valid reasoning) for 72 hours (3 days). If they need to take a â€œLeave of Absenceâ€ - they must inform Lee-Delgado. Any user violating this rule is subject to an instant fire', '36');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('27', '0', '7', '1464506300', '0', '0', '1', '4', 'Jeff-Thrasos', 'lg-280-110.ch-255-73.ha-3488-62.sh-905-1414.he-3358-71-71.hd-208-8.hr-828-38', 'I fired you all', 'I hate you truly. Truly I do.\rEverything about me hates everything about you.\rThe flick of my wrist hates you.\rThe way I hold my pencil hates you.\rThe sound made by my tiniest bones were they trapped \r      in the jaws of a moray eel hates you.\rEach corpuscle singing in its capillary hates you.', '9828');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('28', '0', '8', '1465065331', '1', '0', '1', '4013', 'Bran-Riviera', 'ch-3110-76.hd-3092-1007.cp-3316-1408.ca-3410-1191.ha-3026-1189.sh-305-68.cc-3007-1189.lg-3202-1320.hr-831-1044.-180-12', 'Worker Rules', '1) No going AFK (sleeping seeing the ZZz\'s)\r\r2) No equipping your weapons while working\r\r3) No homophobic/racist/abusive language\r\r4) No arguing with other work members\r\r5) No asking for promotions\r\r', '4360');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('29', '0', '8', '1465065450', '1', '0', '0', '4013', 'Bran-Riviera', 'ch-3110-76.hd-3092-1007.cp-3316-1408.ca-3410-1191.ha-3026-1189.sh-305-68.cc-3007-1189.lg-3202-1320.hr-831-1044.-180-12', 'Promotion Requirements', '\rServer - 100 minutes or more worked.\r\rCashier - 200 minutes or more worked.\r\rHead Cashier - 300 minutes or more worked.\r\rSupervisor - 600 minutes or more worked', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('30', '28', '8', '1465065649', '0', '0', '0', '4013', 'Bran-Riviera', 'ch-3110-76.hd-3092-1007.cp-3316-1408.ca-3410-1191.ha-3026-1189.sh-305-68.cc-3007-1189.lg-3202-1320.hr-831-1044.-180-12', '', '5 minutes ago Bran-Riviera wrote:\r> 1) No going AFK (sleeping seeing the ZZz\'s)\r> \r> 2) No equipping your weapons while working\r> \r> 3) No homophobic/racist/abusive language\r> \r> 4) No arguing with other work members\r> \r> 5) No asking for promotions (LOOK AT PROMOTION REQUIREMENTS TO SEE HOW TO BE PROMOTED)\r> \r> \r\r', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('31', '0', '8', '1465065763', '0', '0', '1', '4013', 'Bran-Riviera', 'ch-3110-76.hd-3092-1007.cp-3316-1408.ca-3410-1191.ha-3026-1189.sh-305-68.cc-3007-1189.lg-3202-1320.hr-831-1044.-180-12', 'Worker Rules', '1) No going AFK (sleeping seeing the ZZz\'s)\r\r2) No equipping your weapons while working \r\r3) No homophobic/racist/abusive language\r\r4) No arguing with other work members\r \r5) No asking for promotions (SEE PROMOTION REQUIREMENTS THREAD TO SEE HOW TO BE PROMOTED)\r \r\r\r', '4360');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('32', '0', '5', '1467200679', '0', '1', '1', '1710', 'Debbie-Chan', 'hd-629-1370.hr-3012-1036.ch-650-100.sh-3524-100-100.cc-3289-82.he-3329-100-82.lg-700-82.fa-3276-1282', 'Corporation rules', '-Normal Worker Rules-\r>You are not allowed to hit in your corporation room while onduty. (Termination)\r>You are not allowed to hit in your corporation room while offduty. (Suspension: +15 minutes each offence)\r>You may not be biased when distributing your services, you must assist everyone and anyone in need. (Termination)\r>You may not excessively push and pull your co-workers. (Suspension: +5 minutes each offence)\r>You are not allowed to be rude to the customers. (Suspension: +5 minutes each offence)\r>You may not go away from keyboard (AFK) while working. (Suspension: +10 minutes each offence)\r>You may not go inactive for more than 70 hours. (Termination)\r', '8444');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('33', '0', '5', '1467200827', '0', '1', '1', '1710', 'Debbie-Chan', 'hd-629-1370.hr-3012-1036.ch-650-100.sh-3524-100-100.cc-3289-82.he-3329-100-82.lg-700-82.fa-3276-1282', 'Corporatiion Commands', 'To sell pistol\r:offer x pistol\rCost = 1000c\rWe get 50c for selling.\r\rTo sell mp5\r:offer x smg\rCost = 8000c\rWe get 200c for selling.\r\rTo sell bullets\r:offer x bullets (amount)\rCost = 2 bullets cost 1c\rWe dont get anything for selling bullets.\rYou can\'t offer less than 10 bullets.', '8444');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('34', '0', '7', '1467275614', '0', '0', '1', '2923', 'Jace-Axton', 'wa-3264-1193-1408.ha-1011-1189.lg-3361-1189.hd-180-1370.ch-3438-1189-.cc-3360-62.he-3329-1247-1196.hr-3163-34.ca-3175-62', 'Hi I\'m Jace-Axton', 'Hi everyone I\'ve been manager for weeks now and for the new members of the cafe please read the corp rules first in the homepage because I don\'t want to fire someone that doesn\'t even know the rules (it\'s unfair).\r\rSo If you guys were going to ask/ if you\'re curious. I\'m 16 yrs old and I live in the Philippines,  like almost everyone who plays this rp. I do usually go online every 4:00pm-10:00pm here in our time but sometimes if I\'m busy I stay up for just like 8:00pm, but don\'t worry guys I\'m doing my best to go active everyday and to fulfill my duty as the manager (I\'ve been replying to the forums & I go online everyday). I have school for 7:00 am to 2:00pm so that\'s why.\r\rI promise to go online and stay up all night every weekend (fri-sat). I\'m very religious person so I go to church every sunday and I can\'t stay up all night that day cuz I have school the next day. Anyway, I\'m trying to do my best here and If I were to get fired or if I have to pass my position because of being busy in school I\'m willing to do so (but right now I\'m still active so, no). Have a nice day', '2923');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('35', '0', '5', '1467565863', '0', '1', '1', '1710', 'Debbie-Chan', 'lg-3006-71-71.hd-629-1370.ch-665-1314.sh-740-1314.fa-3276-1282.hr-3012-1036.cc-3360-1314.ha-3349-71-1314', 'Supervisor Rules and Commands', '>You may not show favoritism to a worker breaking rules. (Demotion)\r\r>You may not abuse your given commands. (Termination)\r\r>Once a worker has exceded their maximum offences (after a 30 minute sendhome) and they continue, they are to be fired. Report to me with proof(screenie)\r\rYou must also know all the corporation rules inside out so you are able to send a user home if they break any rule.\r\rCommand is\r;sendhome x (minutes)\r', '8444');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('36', '0', '4', '1468660601', '0', '0', '0', '6519', 'Danny-Phantom', 'hd-209-1389.ch-210-73.fa-3276-72.ca-3444-110.he-3218-1193.lg-280-110.ea-3484-1193.hr-115-1031.sh-290-62', 'sleeping when work', 'poeple who work at the phone store the more times you sleep the more you will get sent home. \r\rmaxium send home minutes is 30mins, so im just informing you that you will not want to get that', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('37', '0', '2', '1469184756', '1', '0', '1', '1', 'Jerry-Sumra', 'sh-3115-85-84.ha-3352-84-1408.ca-1801-62.ea-3484-1189.hr-115-61.ch-215-84.lg-3116-110-84.hd-209-2', 'Hello....................', 'Hi......................', '36');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('38', '0', '3', '1469720334', '0', '0', '1', '3828', 'Matthew-Turner', 'hr-115-1036.hd-180-2.ch-255-1189.sh-290-62.he-1608-62.lg-280-91', '[HPD] Rules and Guidelines', 'HoloRP\rPolice Department Rules and Guidelines.\rAll rules listed below are to be followed by every and all Police Officers.\rFailure to abide by these rules will result in being fired from the corporation.\r\rAFK Working:\rAFK (away from keyboard) working is falling asleep OR not answering after a duration of time has passed. If you are through to be AFK working you will be given a 5-10 second countdown to reply. If you do not reply we will assume you have gone AFK and action will be taken.\r\rDisrespect or Disrupting the Peace:\rDisrespect consists of a Police Officer talking down to another member of the Police Department or a Civilian. Police Officers are expected to be respectful to both Civilians and fellow Police Officers at all times. Disrupting the peace means participating or starting any heated argument in public, on or off duty.\rYou are representing the Police Department at all times, keep that in mind when talking to other Civilians.\r\rAbide by the laws:\rAbiding by the laws means you\'re expected to follow all official laws at all times, meaning you\'re not allowed to break any official laws (:laws). You are however permitted to break the laws If you are within a turf zone.\r\rCamping:\rCamping is defined as staying within a room for longer than needed. You are only permitted to stay in a room for 3 minutes. Staying any longer than that is not allowed expect in special cases where people are act‰ºro®úyÚ¢Â7HÃU VëP±OINSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('39', '0', '3', '1469720556', '1', '0', '1', '3828', 'Matthew-Turner', 'hr-115-1036.hd-180-2.ch-255-1189.sh-290-62.he-1608-62.lg-280-91', '[HPD] Rules and Guidelines [UPDATED]', 'HoloRP\rPolice Department Rules and Guidelines.\rAll rules listed below are to be followed by every and all Police Officers.\rFailure to abide by these rules will result in being fired from the corporation.\r\rAFK Working:\rAFK (away from keyboard) working is falling asleep OR not answering after a duration of time has passed. If you are through to be AFK working you will be given a 5-10 second countdown to reply. If you do not reply we will assume you have gone AFK and action will be taken.\r\rDisrespect or Disrupting the Peace:\rDisrespect consists of a Police Officer talking down to another member of the Police Department or a Civilian. Police Officers are expected to be respectful to both Civilians and fellow Police Officers at all times. Disrupting the peace means participating or starting any heated argument in public, on or off duty.\rYou are representing the Police Department at all times, keep that in mind when talking to other Civilians.\r\rAbide by the laws:\rAbiding by the laws means you\'re expected to follow all official laws at all times, meaning you\'re not allowed to break any official laws (:laws). You are however permitted to break the laws If you are within a turf zone.\r\rCamping:\rCamping is defined as staying within a room for longer than needed. You are only permitted to stay in a room for 3 minutes. Staying any longer than that is not allowed expect in ÄƒÌR£	¯ŒiòÆ¢(INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('40', '0', '3', '1469720783', '1', '0', '1', '3828', 'Matthew-Turner', 'hr-115-1036.hd-180-2.ch-255-1189.sh-290-62.he-1608-62.lg-280-91', '[HPD] Rules and Guidelines [UPDATED]', 'HoloRP\rPolice Department Rules and Guidelines.\rAll rules listed below are to be followed by every and all Police Officers.\rFailure to abide by these rules will result in being fired from the corporation.\r\rAFK Working:\rAFK (away from keyboard) working is falling asleep OR not answering after a duration of time has passed. If you are through to be AFK working you will be given a 5-10 second countdown to reply. If you do not reply we will assume you have gone AFK and action will be taken.\r\rDisrespect or Disrupting the Peace:\rDisrespect consists of a Police Officer talking down to another member of the Police Department or a Civilian. Police Officers are expected to be respectful to both Civilians and fellow Police Officers at all times. Disrupting the peace means participating or starting any heated argument in public, on or off duty.\rYou are representing the Police Department at all times, keep that in mind when talking to other Civilians.\r\rAbide by the laws:\rAbiding by the laws means you\'re expected to follow all official laws at all times, meaning you\'re not allowed to break any official laws (:laws). You are however permitted to break the laws If you are within a turf zone.\r\rCamping:\rCamping is defined as staying within a room for longer than needed. You are only permitted to stay in a room for 3 minutes. Staying any longer than that is not allowed expect in [Øg\0öØqè¸¯R&|î\"ÆINSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('41', '40', '3', '1469720941', '0', '0', '0', '3828', 'Matthew-Turner', 'hr-115-1036.hd-180-2.ch-255-1189.sh-290-62.he-1608-62.lg-280-91', '', '2 minutes ago Matthew-Turner wrote:\r> HoloRP\r> Police Department Rules and Guidelines.\r> All rules listed below are to be followed by every and all Police Officers.\r> Failure to abide by these rules will result in being fired from the corporation.\r> \r> AFK Working:\r> AFK (away from keyboard) working is falling asleep OR not answering after a duration of time has passed. If you are through to be AFK working you will be given a 5-10 second countdown to reply. If you do not reply we will assume you have gone AFK and action will be taken.\r> \r> Disrespect or Disrupting the Peace:\r> Disrespect consists of a Police Officer talking down to another member of the Police Department or a Civilian. Police Officers are expected to be respectful to both Civilians and fellow Police Officers at all times. Disrupting the peace means participating or starting any heated argument in public, on or off duty.\r> You are representing the Police Department at all times, keep that in mind when talking to other Civilians.\r> \r> Abide by the laws:\r> Abiding by the laws means you\'re expected to follow all official laws at all times, meaning you\'re not allowed to break any official laws (:laws). You are however permitted to break the laws If you are within a turf zone.\r\r\r', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('42', '0', '3', '1469721742', '1', '0', '1', '3828', 'Matthew-Turner', 'hr-115-1036.hd-180-2.ch-255-1189.sh-290-62.he-1608-62.lg-280-91', '[HPD] Rules and Guidelines [UPDATED]', 'HoloRP Police Department Rules and Guidelines\r\rAll rules listed below are to be followed by every and all Police Officers. Failure to abide by these rules will result in being fired from the corporation.\r\rThe link to the rules is: https://goo.gl/zJTlud\r\rThanks,\rMatthew', '3828');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('43', '0', '3', '1469794889', '1', '0', '0', '3828', 'Matthew-Turner', 'hr-115-1036.hd-180-2.ch-255-1189.sh-290-62.he-1608-62.lg-280-91', '[HPD] Rules and Guidelines [UPDATED]', 'HoloRP Police Department Rules and Guidelines:\r\rAll rules listed In this word document are to be followed by every and all Police Officers. Failure to abide by these rulese will result in being fired from the corporation.\r\rThe link to the rules can be found here: https://goo.gl/zJTlud\r\rThanks,\rMatthew', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('44', '0', '2', '1470279633', '1', '0', '1', '36', 'Rivatha-Knox', 'ha-3488-0.hd-600-10.hr-3012-1356.ca-1818-62.ch-3135-62.lg-3136-1303', 'Hospital rules', 'Normal Worker Rules\r\rYou may not be biased when distributing your services, you must assist everyone and anyone in need. (Termination)\rYou are not allowed to be rude to the customers. (Suspension: +5 minutes each offence)\rYou may not go away from keyboard (AFK) while working. (Suspension: +10 minutes each offence)\rYou may not go inactive for more than 72 hours. (Termination)\rBreaking these rules may result in a suspension or termination depending on it\'s severity.\r\rSupervisor Rules\r\rSupervisors must follow all of the above rules.\r\rYou may not show favoritism to a worker breaking rules. (Demotion)\rYou may not abuse your given commands. (Termination)\rOnce a worker has exceded their maximum offences (after a 30 minute sendhome) and they continue, they are to be fired.\rBreaking these rules may result in a suspension or termination depending on it\'s severity.\r\rThe following rules are unique to the hospital and MUST be followed.\r\rYou may not ;startwork, heal yourself and ;stopwork if there are other patients that need healing. This rule was implemented by Sumo-Parker. You can find this forum thread athttp://forum.holorp.com/threads/deb...e-allowed-to-startwork-just-to-self-heal.472/ (Suspension: +2 minutes each offence)\r\rAs this is a hospital, the staff must be hygienic. This means that the staff should be clean at all times. (Suspension: +2 minutes each refusal) This means that \r\rYou mu˜KÔV`s Á¶³{ÇO¡*£ymy4nJYINSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('45', '0', '2', '1470280573', '1', '1', '1', '3827', 'Mitch-Wittig', 'ha-1026-110.ca-3151-82-82.ea-3148-62-1408.hr-155-1028.fa-3276-100.hd-3102-1.he-1609-73.ch-255-1228.lg-3116-70-1408', 'Hospital Rules as of Aug 3, 2016', 'Hi everyone,\r\rPlease read the hospital rules from the Holo RP forum.\r\rhttp://forum.holorp.com/threads/hospital-rules.783/#post-2835\r\rThanks!\r\rRivatha-Knox and Mitch-Wittig', '3827');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('46', '0', '5', '1471833553', '1', '0', '0', '8444', 'Alex-Carpolini', 'hr-828-1028.cc-3158-1189.wa-2012-62.hd-190-1.ch-3077-1408-1408.sh-3016-1198.ea-1402-62.lg-280-110', 'Gun store - Commands', 'You can sell : \r\r(pistol) Pistol = 1000 $ \r\r(smg) MP5 = 8000 $\r\r(msg) MSG GUN = 50 000 $\r\rFor sell guns : :offer (username ) ( guns ) \r(you earn 50 c for sell pistol)\r( you earn 200c for sell smg mp5)\r(you earn 500c for sell msg msg gun)\r\rFor sell bullets : :offer (username) bullets (amount)\r(2 bullets = 1 c )\r(minimum = 10 bullets)', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('47', '0', '5', '1471834466', '1', '0', '0', '8444', 'Alex-Carpolini', 'hr-828-1028.cc-3158-1189.wa-2012-62.hd-190-1.ch-3077-1408-1408.sh-3016-1198.ea-1402-62.lg-280-110', 'Gun store - Rules', 'You are not allowed to hit in your corporation room while onduty. (Termination)\r\r You are not allowed to hit in your corporation room while offduty. (Suspension: +15 minutes each offence)\r\r You may not be biased when distributing your services, you must assist everyone and anyone in need. (Termination)\r\r You may not excessively push and pull your co-workers. (Suspension: +5 minutes each offence)\r\r You are not allowed to be rude to the customers. (Suspension: +5 minutes each offence)\r\r You may not go away from keyboard (AFK) while working. (Suspension: +10 minutes each offence)\r\r You may not go inactive for more than 70 hours. (Termination)\r\r', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('48', '47', '5', '1471835096', '0', '0', '0', '8444', 'Alex-Carpolini', 'hr-828-1028.cc-3158-1189.wa-2012-62.hd-190-1.ch-3077-1408-1408.sh-3016-1198.ea-1402-62.lg-280-110', '', 'ADD : Supervisor Rules\r\rSupervisors must follow all of the above rules.\r\r You may not show favoritism to a worker breaking rules. (Demotion)\r\rYou may not abuse your given commands. (Termination)\r', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('49', '46', '5', '1471959682', '0', '0', '0', '8444', 'Alex-Carpolini', 'hr-828-1028.cc-3158-1189.wa-2012-62.hd-190-1.ch-3077-1408-1408.sh-3016-1198.ea-1402-62.lg-280-110', '', '- Update name -\r\rPistol - Glock\r\rmp5 - magnum \r\rmsg gun - mp5 gun', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('50', '0', '2', '1472306858', '1', '0', '0', '3827', 'Mitch-Wittig', 'lg-3116-70-1408.hd-3102-1.fa-3276-100.ha-1026-110.hr-155-1028.ca-3151-82-82.ea-3148-62-1408.ch-255-1228.he-1609-73', 'Hospital Rules and Policies', 'Hi everyone,\r\rPlease refer to this Google Doc to keep up to date on rules and policies for the hospital.\r\rhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1WMCxAfZrDWgyDwjAR5hLfBTvQKnXnDAWDeyhSU6UQ7U/edit?usp=sharing\r\rThank you,\r\rMitch-Wittig and Rivatha-Knox', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('51', '50', '2', '1472364849', '0', '0', '0', '3827', 'Mitch-Wittig', 'lg-3116-70-1408.hd-3102-1.fa-3276-100.ha-1026-110.hr-155-1028.ca-3151-82-82.ea-3148-62-1408.ch-255-1228.he-1609-73', '', 'Shortened URL for those who don\'t want to type it all out:\r\rhttp://goo.gl/jXzdrA\r\rThanks,\r\rMitch-Wittig and Rivatha-Knox', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('52', '0', '8', '1472833659', '0', '0', '0', '4360', 'Pooh-Taka', 'fa-3296-1219.hr-3012-45.ha-3156-63.he-3376-62-1408.lg-3006-63-1408.hd-605-10.cc-3360-62.ch-665-63.ca-3292-62', 'Worker\'s Rules', '\r1. No Afking (the Zzz)\r \r2. Don\'t Argue with the customers\r\r3. Don\'t Argue with the other workers\r\r4. Don\'t ask for promotions \r\r5. Respect everyone inside the corp', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('53', '0', '8', '1472990513', '1', '0', '0', '103', 'John-Paul', 'sh-305-68.cc-3007-1189.-180-12.ca-3410-1191.hr-831-34.hd-3091-1.ha-3026-1189.ch-3110-76.lg-3202-1320.wa-3211-1189', 'AFK while Working', 'For those who are AFKing and AFKQueens please stop being from like that. If we the Managers see that you are AFK while working will be Send Home for 10mins Thank You.', '0');
INSERT INTO `groups_forums_posts` VALUES ('54', '0', '7', '1473109204', '1', '1', '0', '9828', 'Jeremy-Angley', 'ch-255-106.ha-3480-1428.fa-1202-1314.hd-180-18.ca-1801-110.hr-828-52.lg-280-1408', 'Corp Rules                           ', 'Normal Worker Rules\rYou are not allowed to hit in your corporation room while onduty. (Termination)\rYou are not allowed to hit in your corporation room while offduty. (Suspension: +15 minutes each offence)\rYou may not be biased when distributing your services, you must assist everyone and anyone in need. (Termination)\rYou may not excessively push and pull your co-workers. (Suspension: +5 minutes each offence)\rYou are not allowed to be rude to the customers. (Suspension: +5 minutes each offence)\rYou may not go away from keyboard (AFK) while working. (Suspension: +10 minutes each offence)\rYou may not go inactive for more than 70 hours. (Termination)\rBreaking these rules may result in a suspension or termination depending on it\'s severity.\r\rSupervisor Rules\r\rSupervisors must follow all of the above rules.\rYou may not show favoritism to a worker breaking rules. (Demotion)\rYou may not abuse your given commands. (Termination)\rOnce a worker has exceded their maximum offences (after a 30 minute sendhome) and they continue, they are to be fired.\rBreaking these rules may result in a suspension or termination depending on it\'s severity.\rManager Rules\r\rManagers must follow all of the above rules.\rYou may not promote a worker to supervisor (or any rank) if they do not have the alloted minutes. (Termination)\rYou may not demote or fire a worker without an appropriate reasonºØ.oBî\r¤Š¡¥|û³\'z³‚MZÒfË#wŠÞNøŸÂ‘s´¤_aõŽ†_8$­ç²?õ$\\êôÀXµã¿À…²Ÿ<G2a79›(ÒHC³ç¿ØXÑ\\Fa}A²§×iè\'(¡·+ž½žºINSERT INTO `groups_items` VALUES ('base', '1', 'base_basic_1.gif', '', '1');
