INSERT INTO `server_settings` VALUES ('welcome_message', 'Welcome [back] to HoloRP v1.6.4, providing you a realistic environment.\r\nOn Sunday, 18th September, 2016 - we have updated the RP with new features and possible bug fixes.\r\nChangelog:\\r\\n[¥] You can now follow your contacts ONLY IF they have you as a contact/friend. This allows you to taxi to the room your contact/friend is currently in. If you don\'t want to be followed by your contacts, toggle contact following by using \':toggletexts\'.\\r\\n[¥] Implemented a new way to receive notifications. To see what it looks like, try texting someone, sending a help ticket, purchasing clothing, get wanted, and if you\'re a Police Officer, trying lawing/arresting someone. :)\\r\\n[¥] General bug fixes and improvements.\r\n----------------------------------------------\r\nChangelog (v1.6.3, 17th September, 2016):\\r\\n[¥] When the defendant is pledged as innocent in Court, it will now award the juries money and won\'t bug now.\\r\\n[¥] Rooms will not unload at all now unless a staff member unloads it for room maintenance. In addition, when you are the only one in a farming plot room and you leave the room, the room won\'t unload and you won\'t lose your plants now.\\r\\n[¥] Changed the logout enable and added the \"ZZZ\" animation when a player logs out from the game.\\r\\n[¥] General bug fixes and improvements.\r\n----------------------------------------------\r\nChangelog (v1.6.2, 12th September, 2016):\\r\\n[¥] A few minor changes to the Court system and removed the 20% chance of the defendant being pledged as guilty when the juries voted innocent.\\r\\n[¥] Most of the action shouts has been removed such as \'Falls asleep for being AFK for too long\', \'Wakes up from being AFK\', \'Hops off their Car as they have entered a no-drive room\', etc. When sending and receiving text messages, a whisper will be sent to you (others in the room cannot see the whisper), the phone enable is still there to indicate others in the room that you\'ve sending and receiving text messages.\\r\\n[¥] Removed garbage and pointless features from the server *coughs*.\\r\\n[¥] General bug fixes and improvements.\r\n----------------------------------------------\r\nChangelog (v1.6.1, 2nd September, 2016):\\r\\n[¥] Changes to staff permissions.\\r\\n[¥] Fixed a typo with ;sex command when a female is having sex with a male.\\r\\n[¥] General bug fixes and improvements.\r\n----------------------------------------------\r\nChangelog (v1.6, 1st September, 2016):\\r\\n[¥] New mini-game: Mafia Wars.\\r\\n[¥] Re-enabled the :me command.\\r\\n[¥] Bot AI system changes & improvements.\\r\\n[¥] General bug fixes and improvements.\r\nPlease continue to send us feedback / suggestions by creating a thread on http://forum.holorp.com/forums/22/. We are listening!', 'If the value isn\'t empty then a message will be shown to the user when they login.');
